cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use Lyceum, the math semantic graph design, the evaluation
  harness, or any of the material in this repository in your research,
  please cite the paper below.  Citation details below are placeholders
  until the paper is accepted; they will be updated with the journal
  reference, DOI, volume / issue / pages on publication.
title: >
  Lyceum: a fully-local multimodal system for narrated visualisation
  of mathematical textbooks
authors:
  - family-names: "Kermani Kolankeh"
